Description: ChirpStack LoRaWAN Network Server
 ChirpStack is an open-source LoRaWAN Network Server with a built-in
 web interface. Supports SQLite or PostgreSQL as the database backend,
 Redis for caching, and MQTT (Mosquitto) for integration.
